        "message": "sqflite_common: 2.5.16 single instance cache, batch in the open callbacks\n\nFixes from a code review, each with a regression test:\n- single instance cache: closing an already closed database dropped a newer\n  instance at the same path; after an onDatabaseDowngradeDelete open or a\n  deleteDatabase through SqfliteDatabaseFactoryLogger, openDatabase returned\n  a second (or the deleted) instance\n- Batch.apply() in onCreate/onUpgrade/onDowngrade hung (outside the open\n  transaction)\n- openDatabase modified the given OpenDatabaseOptions\n- DatabaseException.getResultCode() threw without a message\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011Mtk7ocTedCc2yusUn8WWq"
      }
    },
